Demo CLI.

  php demo.php <command> [options]
  php demo.php help [<command>] [--json]

Read:
  env                    Say which host.
  contracts [--nr=<nr>]  Filter by number.
  events --msa=<msaNr>[,<msaNr>...] [--ids=<id>[,<id>...]]
         [--colours=<red|green|blue>[,...]]
                         Comma-separated values.
  typed --colour=<red|green|blue> [--count=<n>] [--at=<ATOM>] [--on=<Y-m-d>] [--note=<note>]
                         Typed values.
  report [--code=<n>]    Text output, custom exit code.
  nope                   Fail from a helper.
  fault                  Throw something undeclared.

Write:
  save --what=<what>     Write something.
  rename                 Name the running command without a literal.

Options:
  --raw                  Print the raw response.
  --help                 Print this.

Footer prose.
